            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\nThe flow creates one board and deletes it at the end. On a Free plan a team can have at most 3 editable boards, so run it in the Developer team (or a team with fewer than 3 boards). Share Board sends a real invitation to test@appmixer.ai; the assertion only checks that Miro answered with the invited and failed counts, because whether the invitation succeeds depends on the board's sharing policy."
